      "MISTY: ... hashtag LifeGoals. So, this was supposed to be three minutes and I’m going on like ten. Sorry, not sorry.\nMISTY: To wrap things up... Tala, girl, you’re the sister I always wanted.\nTALA: Love you, babe!",
      "MISTY: Oh, wait, there’s still another page. I’ll make this quick.\nMISTY: I decided to Google the two most important things about marriage. Love and Commitment.\nSARAH: Jesus Christ.\nMISTY: Love is “to feel a deep romantic or sexual attachment to someone.” We know they’re fine in that department.",
      "SARAH: YOU!\nSARAH: What the fuck did you do to me?\nSARAH: Tell me what the fuck is going on!\nTALA: Sarah!",
      "PIA: Tala should be done with her make- up soon, so you need to be ready.\nSARAH: I need a minute.\nPIA: She made a specific order for you girls, and we already moved Misty up because we couldn’t find you.\nSARAH: This is really happening, right?",
      "SARAH: It was real. It felt so real.\nPIA: Are you on drugs again?"
    ]
